%% Platform dependency health and operational status aggregation
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Operator
    participant Console as Operations console
    participant API as Health API
    participant Health as OperationsHealthService
    participant Control as Control-plane DB
    participant Tenant as Tenant registry/DB probes
    participant Redis
    participant Queue as BullMQ queues
    participant Backup as Backup/restore evidence

    Operator->>Console: Open system, database, or domain health
    Console->>API: GET health endpoint
    API->>Health: Collect bounded evidence
    par Control plane
        Health->>Control: Probe connectivity and latency
    and Tenant fleet
        Health->>Tenant: Check registry state and schema readiness
    and Redis
        Health->>Redis: Probe connectivity and safe metrics
    and Queues
        Health->>Queue: Read waiting/active/failed counts
    and Recovery
        Health->>Backup: Read latest backup and restore verification
    end
    Health->>Health: Aggregate HEALTHY, DEGRADED, or UNAVAILABLE
    Health-->>API: Sanitized status and launch blockers
    API-->>Console: Operator-readable health response
